OL,3,GNEWSAUnexploded WW2 bomb detonated at
OL,4,Asea
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn unexploded World War Two bomb that
OL,7,Fforced the evacuation of about 2,000
OL,8,Fpeople from their homes has been safely
OL,9,Fdetonated at sea, causing a small plume
OL,10,Fof water.
OL,12,FThe suspected 250lb (115kg) American
OL,13,Fair-dropped bomb was discovered in the
OL,14,Fwater at Falmouth Docks on 21
OL,15,FSeptember, leading to a major emergency
OL,16,Fresponse and the evacuation of
OL,17,Fresidents from more than 300
OL,18,Fhouseholds.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
PN,34402
