OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAUnexploded WW2 bomb detonated at
OL,4,Asea
OL,5,
OL,6,FLt Matt Bowden, officer in charge of
OL,7,FRoyal Navy Bravo Diving Unit 1, said a
OL,8,Fdiver attached an explosive charge to
OL,9,Fthe bomb and detonated it.
OL,11,FDespite blustery conditions on Tuesday,
OL,12,FBowden said the operation was "a fairly
OL,13,Fstraightforward procedure for us".
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
